 Keep your eyes peeled for Alligators, Dolphins, manatees, and over 300 bird species that inhabit this remarkable\nlandscape.\n___________________________________\n##What to Bring\n-National Park Pass\n-Guests should consider bringing sunglasses, a hat, sunscreen, and water. \n-Snacks, Drinks, and Souvenirs are available in the gift shop before departure.\n___________________________________\n##Additional Info\n-Not ADA Accessible\n-No ramp to board dock or vessel\n-No shade top, boat enters low mangrove tunnels", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Everglades National Park, 905 Copeland Ave, Everglades City, FL 34139", "booking_notes": "![EC Logo](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Di5XfrGRR4CxBVUCBxK1)\n# Arrival Information\nPlease meet us at the lookout Gift Shop under the 10,000 Islands Observation Tower @ 905 Copeland Ave in Everglades City, Just after the Gulf Coast Visitor Center entrance. Bring a hat, sunglasses, and bug spray. We have water and Grab N Go items for purchase in the gift shop. Look forward to seeing you!\n\n## What to Bring:\n\n\n- Sunglasses\n- A Hat\n- Sunscreen\n- Water\n- Rain gear (such as a poncho) is recommended for days when rainy weather is expected. \n- National Park Pass\n\nTrips board 5 min before departing and everyone needs to present for the safety briefing.\nWe do our best to ensure that trips leave at their scheduled departure, so it is very important to be on time! \n- Vessel is not ADA accessible\n- No ramp to board the boat\n- Open top on vessel so it can enter mangrove tunnels \n\n## Stopping By Flamingo During Your Stay?\n\n### Book a Backcountry or Florida Bay Boat Tour and RECEIVE 15% OFF\nUSE PROMO CODE ***\"EVERGLADES\"*** TO REDEEM YOUR DISCOUNT\n\n![Flamingo Boat](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/v23DRehjQW2xLBsKAvLo)\n\n>>[**CLICK HERE TO BOOK A FLAMINGO TOUR!**](https://fareharbor.com/flamingoeverglades/items/?flow=135567)<<", "cancellation_notes": "Customers will 